Here is the continuation and completion of the IntarsiaML architecture plan, picking up from the `mermaid` diagram and proceeding through the remaining sections of the v0.2 specification.

---

```mermaid
  subgraph Core["Engine core (crate: intarsia-core)"]
    SCHED["Scheduler: Pre-fill, Decode, Prefetch"]
    KV["KV Cache: Paged, Swap, Async"]
    MODEL["Model: Block graph, Recipe loader"]
  end
  subgraph Kernels["Kernel Packs (ABI: intarsia-kernel-abi)"]
    TF["TensorFold: GEMM, MoE, FlashAttention"]
    RAD["Radiance: Norm, Rope, Quant, Elementwise"]
    PORT["Portable: ik_portable.h (CUDA/HIP)"]
  end
  subgraph Host["Host (crate: intarsia-server)"]
    OAI --> SCHED
    ANT --> SCHED
    UI --> MET
    MET --> SCHED
    SCHED --> MODEL
    MODEL --> Kernels
  end
```

